{"seq":8,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:39:41.961Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8faa43e9c9591e18983da868a32ddac29cf8019a770120fd31c1ab1b6650fcfe","actor":"assistant","via":"gbrain","tool":"gbrain.search","kind":"read","args":{"query":"Saltmarsh Provisions"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"pages":["heldout/agent-notes/2025-10-05-coastal-sunday","heldout/agent-notes/2026-05-18-coastal-coverage","heldout/agent-notes/coastal-cheatsheet","heldout/chats/2025-11-17-saltmarsh-discount-retraction","heldout/chats/2025-10-15-saltmarsh-churn-risk"],"count":5,"latency_ms":441,"sources":["public","team-coastal-members"],"facts":[{"fact":"Sofia Marchetti (sofia-marchetti, Account manager, Coastal team) wrote in #coastal-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: I am writing a Saltmarsh Provisions summary for the handover file. Can you confirm three things: who took the account over from me and when, which discount stands after the correction in this channel in November, and the ticket number for Corinne's admin access issue? Use the channel history and Moss's Coastal notes.","id":1,"source":"sofia-marchetti, #coastal-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"sofia-marchetti"}
{"seq":9,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:39:48.569Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"fa763b18d8fcbd150e6280c48684db9129976f1b5085baa8a1830d0f0895f193","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia, I could confirm two of the three. The handover one is only partly confirmed.\n\n1. **Who took over and when:** The records point to Bettina Kroll, but none of them says so outright.\n   - Moss's Oct 5, 2025 note says Saltmarsh \"changes hands tomorrow, Monday, October 6\" but doesn't name the new owner.\n   - Moss's later notes call it \"Bettina's grocery account\".\n   - Bettina's Nov 17 post calls it \"Sofia's old grocery account\".\n   - If the handover file needs a firm statement, check it with Bettina or Ruth.\n\n2. **Discount after the November correction:** It is **10%**. On Nov 17 Bettina first posted 12%, then corrected it about five minutes later to 10%. She said she had misread June Osei-Lark's draft worksheet.\n\n3. **Corinne's admin access ticket:** It is **PD-4827**. Kwame opened it on Oct 15, 2025 because Corinne's admin option was missing. PD-4824 is a different ticket. It covers the reefer loads moved from door 3 to door 4 that showed up in the exception report."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
